[{"name":"MultiGrid","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"7355486f-75f9-490d-b132-1b957b7af89f","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"columnWidths":[3,9],"layout":{"gap":"L","marginTop":0,"marginBottom":0,"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"visible":true,"columnWidthsTablet":[12,12]},"content":[{"name":"LaccicoKategoriebaum","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"d63554e0-5326-4352-8a61-c5e301b326cc","isGlobalTemplate":false},"parent_slot":0,"slot_index":0,"content":{"anzeigen":true}},{"name":"DetailsList","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"a6171aec-7991-4c25-bfcc-debcdb08aa89","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"visible":true,"layout":{"fullWidth":false,"caretPosition":"right"}},"content":[{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"7b6e0277-6599-42ef-809e-db921514a847","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"mb-2\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>Le F6-XR est un lacet plat ciré de 6 mm de large, en 100 % coton, aux brins épais. Il a plus de volume, car davantage de fil y est tressé, et a un aspect rustique.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><p class=\"mb-2\">Comparé au F6-CS, il est plus épais et plus lourd. Son toucher à la fois souple et massif vient des brins, non de la cire. Ciré, laminé à chaud et poli, il a un brillant mat et soyeux. La cire pénètre le tressage et protège la fibre. Pour un lacet plus fin au tressage discret, prenez le F6-CS.</p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-none bg-light p-2 mb-2 border rounded\"><span class=\"small font-weight-bold text-dark\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right text-muted mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Le F6-XR en bref&nbsp;</span> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary py-1 px-2\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-arrows-h mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Faites glisser sur le côté&nbsp;</span></div></div><div class=\"laccico-scroll-wrapper\"><div class=\"table-responsive laccico-scroll-table\"><table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover text-left mb-0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000000; font-size: 0.9rem; min-width: 560px;\"><thead class=\"thead-dark\" style=\"background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff;\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Caractéristique</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">F6-XR Xtra Robust</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Largeur<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Forme</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">6 mm, plat.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Matière<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Fibre</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">100 % coton, ciré.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Tressage<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Aspect</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Brins épais, rustique.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Toucher<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">En main</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">À la fois souple et massif.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Brillant<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Cirage</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Laminé à chaud et poli, mat et soyeux.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Longueurs<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Gamme</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">75, 90, 120 et 150 cm.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Plus fin<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Série sœur</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/fr/forme-et-diametre/lacets-plats-classes-par-largeur/lacets-plats-de-6-mm/f6cs\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6-CS</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"configuration":{"visible":true,"detailsSettings":{"label":"Qu'est-ce qui caractérise la série Xtra Robust (F6-XR) parmi les lacets plats de 6 mm ?","defaultOpen":false}}},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"dde3f716-ff26-4da4-8774-2e9d08224a75","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"mb-2\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>Le F6-XR convient aux chaussures au look vintage, heritage et workwear à œillets visibles d'un diamètre intérieur de 5 mm ou plus : boots moc-toe, boots workwear, bottes à lacets et baskets au look vintage.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><p class=\"mb-2\">Le tressage marqué du F6-XR s'accorde avec un cuir robuste et une semelle affirmée. Sur les baskets montantes au look workwear, le F6-CS fait aussi bien que le F6-XR. Pour des baskets en cuir raffinées, le F6-CS, plus fin, est le meilleur choix.</p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-none bg-light p-2 mb-2 border rounded\"><span class=\"small font-weight-bold text-dark\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right text-muted mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Chaussures&nbsp;</span> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary py-1 px-2\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-arrows-h mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Faites glisser sur le côté&nbsp;</span></div></div><div class=\"laccico-scroll-wrapper\"><div class=\"table-responsive laccico-scroll-table\"><table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover text-left mb-0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000000; font-size: 0.9rem; min-width: 560px;\"><thead class=\"thead-dark\" style=\"background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff;\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Chaussure</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Œillets</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Lacet</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Boots moc-toe<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Heritage</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Œillets, souvent avec crochets.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\"><span class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\">F6-XR</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Boots workwear<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Robustes</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Œillets visibles, crochets.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\"><span class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\">F6-XR</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Bottes à lacets<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Tige haute</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Œillets visibles, crochets en haut.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\"><span class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\">F6-XR</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Baskets<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Look vintage</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Œillets visibles.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\"><span class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\">F6-XR</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Baskets montantes<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Look workwear</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Œillets visibles.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\"><span class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\">F6-XR</span> · <a href=\"/fr/forme-et-diametre/lacets-plats-classes-par-largeur/lacets-plats-de-6-mm/f6cs\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6-CS</a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Baskets en cuir<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Raffinées</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Œillets visibles.</td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/fr/forme-et-diametre/lacets-plats-classes-par-largeur/lacets-plats-de-6-mm/f6cs\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">F6-CS</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"configuration":{"visible":true,"detailsSettings":{"label":"Quels types de chaussures et de bottes profitent le plus de la série F6-XR ?","defaultOpen":false}}},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"f5863595-7f74-41ed-8370-eebb46862317","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"mb-2\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>Le F6-XR existe en 11 couleurs et en 75, 90, 120 et 150 cm.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><p class=\"mb-2\">À côté du noir, de l'anthracite et du blanc, il existe le beige et trois tons de brun, ainsi que le jaune signalisation, le rouge vin, le vert et le bleu. Le F6-CS offre un choix plus large, avec 50 couleurs.</p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-none bg-light p-2 mb-2 border rounded\"><span class=\"small font-weight-bold text-dark\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right text-muted mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Couleurs&nbsp;</span> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary py-1 px-2\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-arrows-h mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Faites glisser sur le côté&nbsp;</span></div></div><div class=\"laccico-scroll-wrapper\"><div class=\"table-responsive laccico-scroll-table\"><table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover text-left mb-0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000000; font-size: 0.9rem; min-width: 560px;\"><thead class=\"thead-dark\" style=\"background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff;\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Univers de couleurs</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Couleurs F6-XR</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Noir<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">1 couleur</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Noir</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Blanc &amp; crème<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">1 couleur</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Blanc</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Gris<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">1 couleur</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Anthracite</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Brun &amp; beige<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">4 couleurs</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Beige, brun clair, brun caramel, brun foncé</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Jaune<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">1 couleur</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Jaune signalisation</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Rouge &amp; rose<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">1 couleur</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Rouge vin</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Vert<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">1 couleur</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Vert</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Bleu<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">1 couleur</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Bleu</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"configuration":{"visible":true,"detailsSettings":{"label":"Quelles couleurs existent pour le lacet plat ciré de 6 mm F6-XR ?","defaultOpen":false}}},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"d5739f2e-3758-4c6d-83ec-75a481e28910","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"mb-2\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>On pose le lacet plat dans le crochet : d'abord croiser, puis poser sous tension. Si on le serre dans la gorge du crochet, il s'use vite.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><p class=\"mb-2\">Une mauvaise direction de traction est la cause la plus fréquente d'usure précoce sur les crochets. Dans les œillets du dessous, guidez le lacet d'une main à travers l'œillet et laissez glisser l'extrémité libre sur un doigt de l'autre main, sous une légère tension. Ne tirez que lorsque le lacet est bien à plat.</p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-none bg-light p-2 mb-2 border rounded\"><span class=\"small font-weight-bold text-dark\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right text-muted mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Œillets &amp; crochets&nbsp;</span> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary py-1 px-2\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-arrows-h mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Faites glisser sur le côté&nbsp;</span></div></div><div class=\"laccico-scroll-wrapper\"><div class=\"table-responsive laccico-scroll-table\"><table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover text-left mb-0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000000; font-size: 0.9rem; min-width: 560px;\"><thead class=\"thead-dark\" style=\"background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff;\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Étape</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Que faire</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Œillets<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Partie basse</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Passer le lacet avec une légère contre-tension, ne tirer que lorsqu'il est à plat.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Croiser<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Avant chaque crochet</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">D'abord croiser, puis amener au crochet.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Crochets<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Partie haute</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Poser sous tension, ne pas serrer dans la gorge du crochet.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">Vrillé<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Avant de serrer</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Une fois serré vrillé, le lacet se corrige difficilement. Vérifiez donc avant que le lacet est bien à plat.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">S'use vite<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Bavures</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Les crochets ou les œillets ont souvent des bavures coupantes. Les ébavurer une fois aide.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"configuration":{"visible":true,"detailsSettings":{"label":"Comment lacer des lacets plats F6-XR sur des boots à crochets ?","defaultOpen":false}}},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"e1fb0d1c-c2f3-42aa-9bc1-d9fd29016a86","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<div class=\"mb-2\"><p class=\"mb-2\"><strong>Le plus sûr est de mesurer les anciens lacets délacés, d'une extrémité à l'autre. Le F6-XR existe en 75, 90, 120 et 150 cm.</strong></p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><p class=\"mb-2\">La longueur nécessaire dépend du type de laçage, de la hauteur de la tige et du pied, et sur les boots, les œillets sont très espacés. C'est pourquoi une règle empirique selon les paires d'œillets n'aide guère ici.</p><p class=\"mb-2\"><br></p><div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-none bg-light p-2 mb-2 border rounded\"><span class=\"small font-weight-bold text-dark\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-hand-o-right text-muted mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Longueurs&nbsp;</span> <span class=\"badge badge-secondary py-1 px-2\">&nbsp;<i class=\"fa fa-arrows-h mr-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> Faites glisser sur le côté&nbsp;</span></div></div><div class=\"laccico-scroll-wrapper\"><div class=\"table-responsive laccico-scroll-table\"><table class=\"table table-bordered table-hover text-left mb-0\" style=\"border: 1px solid #000000; font-size: 0.9rem; min-width: 560px;\"><thead class=\"thead-dark\" style=\"background-color: #000000; color: #ffffff;\"><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Longueur</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"py-3 px-3\">Chaussures typiques</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">75 cm<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Court</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Chaussures basses et baskets à peu d'œillets.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">90 cm<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Moyen</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Baskets basses au look vintage.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">120 cm<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Long</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Boots montantes à la cheville, boots moc-toe.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">150 cm<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">Très long</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle\">Bottes hautes à lacets, boots workwear.</td></tr><tr><td class=\"font-weight-bold py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\">En savoir plus<br><span class=\"small text-muted font-weight-normal\">FAQ</span></td><td class=\"py-3 px-3 align-middle text-nowrap\"><a href=\"/fr/laccicolacetsfinscires/faq\" class=\"font-weight-bold text-dark d-block\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Nos questions fréquentes</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p>Plus de détails sur notre page <a href=\"/fr/laccicolacetsfinscires/longueur-des-lacets\" style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-weight:600;text-decoration:underline\">Longueur des lacets</a>.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"configuration":{"visible":true,"detailsSettings":{"label":"Quelle longueur de lacet choisir pour la série F6-XR sur des bottes et des boots ?","defaultOpen":false}}}],"parent_slot":0,"slot_index":1},{"name":"CategoryData","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"3568e024-ede4-43df-9930-335a3956df60","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"name":"","fields":{"name":true,"description1":true,"description2":false,"shortDescription":false},"fieldsOrder":["name","description1","description2","shortDescription"],"fieldsDisabled":[],"displayCategoryImage":"off","image":{"fillMode":"fill","alt":"","brightness":0.75},"text":{"color":"#121212","bgColor":"#fbfbf9","bgOpacity":1,"textAlignment":"left","justify":"top","align":"left","background":false},"layout":{"paddingTop":16,"paddingBottom":16,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":1,"slot_index":0},{"name":"SortFilter","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"2d432bf6-8f93-417c-87d5-6e8068018df9","isGlobalTemplate":false},"parent_slot":1,"slot_index":1,"content":{"fields":{"category":false,"sortBy":true,"perPage":true,"itemRating":false,"manufacturer":false,"price":fa